  "body": "## Features\r\n* Fall back between HID backends within a single run by @carlossless in https://github.com/carlossless/sinowisp/pull/152\r\n* Warn when a bootloader read does not look like a bootloader by @carlossless in https://github.com/carlossless/sinowisp/pull/157\r\n\r\n## Fixes\r\n* zifriend-za981 and sh68f902 fixes by @carlossless in https://github.com/carlossless/sinowisp/pull/153\r\n* Mark the Trust GXT 960 bootloader as failing on macOS by @carlossless in https://github.com/carlossless/sinowisp/pull/151\r\n* Undo the 571ea8b3 bootloader's byte skew on ISP transfers by @carlossless in https://github.com/carlossless/sinowisp/pull/154\r\n* Record verified macOS and Windows bootloader support by @carlossless in https://github.com/carlossless/sinowisp/pull/158\r\n\r\n## New devices\r\n* device: redragon-k647wg-soraka by @carlossless in https://github.com/carlossless/sinowisp/pull/156\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/carlossless/sinowisp/compare/v2.0.1...v2.1.0",
